comment0.text=\r\n\ Question\ 3(c)\r\n\ \r\n\ A\ class\ to\ create\ Virtual\ Machine\ objects\ that\ hold\ a\ state\r\n\ that\ includes\ machine\ creation\ number,\ machine\ ID,\r\n\ CPU\ processing\ power,\ physical\ memory\ and\ \r\n\ number\ of\ connected\ users\r\n\r\n\ @author\ Ryan\ Le\ Roux\r\n\ @version\ 1.0\r\n
